    <string name="memory_footer_lock_screen">Robot keeps what you ask it to (“remember that …”, “souviens-toi que …”) in one file on this phone, encrypted with a key that also works while the phone is locked (the lock screen\'s switch above), and never backed up. “Forget that” removes the last thing; Undo puts it back. Passwords, PINs and card numbers you ask it to keep stay private: never spoken unless you ask for one by name, never in an answer unless the question names it, never sent to a helper. Robot doesn\'t keep them from a conversation by itself. History keeps which things an answer used, never their words.</string>
    <string name="memory_footer_unlocked">Robot keeps what you ask it to (“remember that …”, “souviens-toi que …”) in one file on this phone, encrypted with a key that works only while the phone is unlocked, and never backed up. “Forget that” removes the last thing; Undo puts it back. Passwords, PINs and card numbers you ask it to keep stay private: never spoken unless you ask for one by name, never in an answer unless the question names it, never sent to a helper. Robot doesn\'t keep them from a conversation by itself. History keeps which things an answer used, never their words.</string>
